{'symbol': 'HII', 'date': '2023-03-07 10:00:00', 'title': 'HII RECEIVES ADDITIVE MANUFACTURING APPROVAL FROM\xa0NAVAL SEA SYSTEMS COMMAND', 'text': 'NEWPORT NEWS, VA., MARCH 07, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- GLOBAL ALL-DOMAIN DEFENSE PARTNER HII (NYSE: HII) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS NEWPORT NEWS SHIPBUILDING DIVISION RECENTLY RECEIVED APPROVAL AS A VENDOR TO PROVIDE SOME ADDITIVE MANUFACTURING COMPONENTS TO NAVAL SEA SYSTEMS (NAVSEA) PLATFORMS.'}